CODEGEN.md §7.8, DECISIONS 320: a record mapped onto a legacy C++ struct is E8019 `LegacyStruct` in every cpp mode (M6), so an @reload on it (E8201) has no case before M6.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// An item.
record Item @cpp(struct: "ItemProp", header: "ItemProp.h", access: fields) {
  /// Its key.
  id: String
}

/// Every item.
@reload let items: [Item] keyed by id = [{ id: "sword" }]

emit cpp { out: "out/", mode: data }
emit json { out: "out/" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8019]  a/a.canon:4:8
  emit cpp in data mode cannot generate a legacy C++ struct (@cpp(struct:)); not before M6: use the generated class meanwhile

